Source: qshare
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Kanta Imai <work@floating-gate.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), golang-go (>= 1.24)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/canta-9142/qshare
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: qshare
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: wl-clipboard | xclip | xsel
Description: Local file sharing with browser-capable devices
 qshare exchanges files and text with smartphones and other browser-capable
 devices over a local network. It does not require cloud storage, an account,
 or a dedicated receiving application.
